# Build directories and binaries produced by `make`. Scoped to this directory on purpose:
# the repository root .gitignore carries a warning about an unanchored pattern that once
# swallowed swe_sr/data/ and hid a third of the tree from ruff.
test-*/
status/
*.bin
*.core
*.elf
*.elf-core
*.img
*.obj
*.map
*.note
*.entry
*.ps
*.log
*.json
*.stamp
*.time
